<title>HUNGARY: Hungary three-month bill yield rises to 21.66 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary three-month bill yield rises to 21.66 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of three-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 20.66 percent, down from 20.70 percent at an auction one week ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     15,457.96  million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	  20.66 percent</p>
<p>    Average price		   95.1015 percent.</p>
</text>
